{"id":50185,"date":"2026-03-28T06:19:01","date_gmt":"2026-03-28T05:19:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50185"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:52:18","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:52:18","slug":"montalegre-urban-fit","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/montalegre-urban-fit\/","title":{"rendered":"Montalegre Urban Fit 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Montalegre Urban Fit 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Montalegre Urban Fit 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>6 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, na m\u00edtica vila barros\u00e3 de <strong>Montalegre<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Vila Real<\/strong>. Promovido pela <strong>Urban Fit Race<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Montalegre<\/strong> e integrado no calend\u00e1rio oficial da <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Corrida de Obst\u00e1culos (FPOCR)<\/strong>, o evento transforma o burgo medieval num aut\u00eantico e desafiante campo de batalha desportiva.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com o monumental Castelo de Montalegre como cen\u00e1rio de fundo, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o arranca \u00e0s <strong>10h00<\/strong> com as vagas de <strong>Elite International e Liga FPOCR (10 km)<\/strong>, seguindo-se a <strong>Liga Competitive<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h15<\/strong> e a categoria aberta <strong>Guerreiro (8 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10h45<\/strong>. Os participantes enfrentam dezenas de obst\u00e1culos desafiantes \u2014 muros de escalada, pir\u00e2mides de madeira, cargas de peso, passagens de \u00e1gua e suspens\u00f5es t\u00e9cnicas \u2014, culminando na conquista da medalha de guerreiro, dorsal com chip e conv\u00edvio popular.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \